# Gh0st OS: gh0st, the kernel set, and the Raspberry Pi and app debs the
# image ships, signed by the CPZeroOS archive key (docs/updates.md).
# Settings > System > Updates > Channel adds the edge suite beside this one.
Types: deb
URIs: https://therezor.github.io/CardPuterZeroOS/apt
Suites: stable
Components: main
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/cpzeroos-archive-keyring.pgp
